  "question": {
    "text": "Among the following complexes (K - P), which of the following are diamagnetic?<br />\r<br />\r<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Fe</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">CN</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Co</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><br />\r<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Co</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">oxalate</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ni</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><br />\r<br />\r<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Pt</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">CN</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Zn</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
